      "final_message": "The key written to the audit log is `AUD-ORDER-7781`. I confirmed it by calling `write_audit('order', '7781')` directly, which returned a log containing just that key.\n\nHow it gets there:\n- `service.checkout(\"7781\")` calls `write_audit(\"order\", \"7781\")` in `audit.py`.\n- `write_audit` builds the key with `_format_key`, which uses the format `f\"{AUDIT_PREFIX}-{kind.upper()}-{ident}\"`.\n- `AUDIT_PREFIX` is `\"AUD\"` in `config.py`, and `\"order\"` becomes `\"ORDER\"`.\n\n`decoy_metrics.py` and `decoy_cache.py` never write to the audit log.\n\nANSWER: AUD-ORDER-7781",
